# Documented false positives for gitleaks.
#
# The pre-commit hook runs `gitleaks protect --staged`, which only sees staged
# changes. A full-history scan (`gitleaks detect`) needs an entry here for any
# finding in a commit that is already pushed. Format:
#
#   <commit>:<path>:<rule>:<line>
#
# Keep this file empty of real secrets: an entry exempts a line from the scan,
# so it is only ever for values that are provably not credentials.
